{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39884","headline":"潘丞相旧宅 · 徐夤","name":"潘丞相旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿树垂枝荫四邻，春风还似旧时春。\n年年燕是雕梁主，处处花随落月尘。\n七贵竟爲长逝客，五侯寻作不归人。\n秋槐影薄蝉声尽，休谓龙门待化鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}